        - [6597069766775, Jie, Yang, 274877909924, "About Manuel Noriega, g, racketeering, and money laundering About Arthur Wellesley, 1st Duke of Wellington, m. He", 1285664359114]
        - [4398046511333, Rafael, "Fernández", 274877912142, "no", 1284613964426]
